      "audiblePhrase": "We considered surveying the whole school, but that's over a thousand students. So we've decided to concentrate on Year 9 only. That's a single year group of about 120. We also need to be careful about cause and association in the Education Survey. Two patterns can occur together without one necessarily producing the other.",
